{"title":"Conference Report: ACEID2023","link":"https://iafor.org/conference-report-aceid2023/","date":1680765328000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ACEID2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"ACEID2023 Group Photo\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ACEID2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ACEID2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-600x600.jpg 600w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ACEID2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ACEID2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ACEID2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-300x300.jpg 300w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/ACEID2023-Group-Photo_1500x750-32x32.jpg 32w\" />From March 27-30, 2023, Tokyo's Toshi Center Hotel became a hub for innovative thoughts and ideas during The 9th Asian Conference on Education &amp; International Development (ACEID2023). This conference was a shining example of IAFOR's determination to champion interdisciplinary dialogues that propel education and international development into new horizons. This hybrid conference was held in <a href=\"https://iafor.org/conference-report-aceid2023/\">...</a>\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/conference-report-aceid2023/\">Source</a></p>","author":"IAFOR","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335cce255aa7e00b46d0931f23a0d47f6","entryHash":"39c6b350ef098c78a230c5c5efcc741ad448256c28c02195ce267b122b70af1a","category":"Interdisciplinary"}